{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"bec9053350d22e5b3a9f60c42412e11371ac008c79abc6b3c1c706fcdaceb3a9","ja":"あ、あの……どう、かな？\nこれで、完成……のつもり、なんだけど……。","zh":"那个……你觉得，怎么样？\n我觉得……这样就算是完成了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"412bb43b4cf87151ded0a037f89f181939c8bac7324315f0aab25af279ca7338","ja":"……不思議だねっ！　フルーツみたいだけど、\n甘くなくって……大人っぽい感じ？","zh":"……真奇妙呢！虽然像水果一样，\n却又不甜……感觉挺成熟的？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"84338cec296ed5375f4d3a2cfbb309dedfd8bb52fa0228435c357d6c0fe8d3cf","ja":"育ちゃんが演じた、イーサンの香水……\n時間が経つと、お、大人な感じが強くなるよ……♪","zh":"育饰演的伊桑的香水……\n随着时间过去，成熟的韵味会越来越浓哦……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"64ddacabb0e112cb47a3ae25aa5d9e4d2a295581612d6c73214c38b73944bed3","ja":"可憐のこだわり、とってもすごいって思うな♪\n役にあわせて、色々考えてるんだね。","zh":"可怜的讲究之处，真的非常厉害呢♪\n有结合角色去思考很多东西呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5088739107fc4b93bed269db42013d8131fe97989e431d3ddcab4623d1bfdf89","ja":"うん！　見た目は子どもだけど、\n本当は大人で迫力満点なイーサンにぴったり！","zh":"嗯！　很适合虽然外表是小孩子，\n但其实是充满魄力的成人的伊森！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"5cb44af7857d526143bb62851bc57c6bff18e8ef1a933e56adc7c957412729ac","ja":"インパクトがある……\nちょいワルな香りを、目指してみたの……。","zh":"很有冲击力……\n想试着展现出那种……带点小使坏的气息。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"f58124c7e301a18275c741228b7c578cbeca443abc2dbc0cb058b8de969d96ec","ja":"ミキのスタークスの香りも、イイって思うな☆\nイケメンで仕事ができる人ってカンジなの！","zh":"美希也觉得斯塔克斯的香气很不错呢☆\n感觉就像帅气又能干的人一样！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d71fb4fbef49da08d48b5d535039c7166f93d05aaf10f86c275f051d48303bdd","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーにもつけてもらおっかな～♪\nありがとね、可憐！","zh":"●●●●让制作人也戴上试试吧～♪\n谢谢你，可怜！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"9d556b29a0578f4acc4ac964546a6e9e5130dcaf1f0b60a414d9f049cf7a1975","ja":"よ、よかった……♪　静香ちゃんと、歩さんの、\n香りも……さ、最初より、深みを出していって……。","zh":"太、太好了……♪　静香和步小姐的\n香气也……比、比起最初变得更有深度了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"2886a2cb04438bb641251fa5c81be6358c741e2d837ee20d12dde51a3db4cf6b","ja":"ふたりのもすてきな香りだねっ！\n可憐さんのゼノビアは、どんな香りなの？","zh":"你们两位的香味也都很棒呢！\n可怜小姐的芝诺比娅是什么香味呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"c43cb605c5ed944230fb1ecbc73d90522e2886f281442ce50229d8fc0e12f43c","ja":"わ、私のは、今、つけてみてるんだけど……。","zh":"我、我的正在试着戴戴看……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"72cdb00126bfe3c6a4dd56354a676368d748cdb5d4d40b7d44f30be622cc5651","ja":"くんくん……へぇ～、\nミキのと全然ちがうんだね？","zh":"闻闻……咦～，\n和美希的完全不一样呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"a4307d8853464f693c3064c855678f37243f1ff50dd62aa7c25b46611fd96944","ja":"なんだかすっごくスパイシーで刺激的なの☆\nなんだか、オトナってカンジ？","zh":"总觉得超级辛辣又刺激呢☆\n总觉得，很有成熟大人的感觉？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"12d87e1b0fa0ab0654c8ef5022d3751602f40ab73a8301a0d913e47842cbb066","ja":"……う、うん。ゼノビアは、刺激的だから……\nそういうところが、表現できたら、って……。","zh":"……嗯、嗯。因为芝诺比娅很有刺激性……\n如果能把那一面表现出来的话，我想……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"2cd0a0fc58b8b4dc902d0b2965e7ad7cf53ca2dfdb5e3e2f9f39a28cc4e6a155","ja":"えへへっ、なんだか可憐さんも、\nいつもよりもっと大人っぽく感じるね！","zh":"嘿嘿，总觉得可怜小姐\n也比平时更有成熟大人的感觉呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"389fa7c8bce5e6fd1df65d6ac5e0e090ed19561909901422bc3690fed108de88","ja":"そ、そうかな……。","zh":"是、是这样吗……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"3aac7f5a8965a117521d618498902c64b053b860602d5b113d6b27c59e3653b2","ja":"うん、ゼノビアの香りをまとった可憐……\nすっごくセクシーで、なんだかドキドキしちゃうの。","zh":"嗯，散发着芝诺比娅香气的可怜……\n非常性感，让人忍不住有些心跳加速呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"19735e0f395db04e2ec80f3045a1a64255de2e5fe0adf3b4b1fc4cabed0ed730","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーも夢中になっちゃうような\n香りって思うな……。","zh":"●●●●我觉得是那种连制作人都会\n为之着迷的香气呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"1d4bfb09b524bf4ce9b2918d428ae0fbbd5d17a78e61403fe1b381524a2bd1fa","ja":"……強力なライバル登場かもなの！","zh":"……强力的竞争对手可能登场了哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"1d81cfe67656dff876d06456fe2d04a7a8b11a2da92b77596ba80fc4c865fab9","ja":"えっ……\nええ～～～っ……！？","zh":"诶……\n诶诶～～～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"d19da357f45d8fb97069759ba14c09e270216a56ccd9cf684bbdff35c83605fb","ja":"……た、たしかに、『危険なのに惹かれる』って\nテーマでちょいワルを表現したけど……。","zh":"……确、确实是以“明明很危险却被深深吸引”为\n主题来表现坏小子的感觉了，不过……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1061.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"3dd7882ad056e6f87c7f268b61822160123b99cdf47cd5abe856d9585019de42","ja":"うう……このあと●●●●プロデューサーさんと\nミーティングなのに……は、恥ずかしい……です……。","zh":"呜呜……待会儿明明还要跟●●●●制作人\n开会……好、好丢脸……啊……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
